WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.780
It’s project time! Make a ScratchJr game where a hero collects three treasures that disappear when touched, and says “You win!” at the end.

2
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:15.120
Your character collects things (gems, apples, coins) around the stage.

3
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.700
Show a score that goes up by 1 for each thing collected.

4
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.070
When everything is collected, say “You win!”.

5
00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:26.450
In ScratchJr, make arrow characters the player taps to move the hero.

6
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:31.310
Collect all 3 coins with ⭐ +1 each, then say “You win!”.

7
00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:34.420
Three coins, score 3, you win!

8
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:38.180
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

9
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.410
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
